 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- `dotenv get` accepts a `--default` option, printed with exit code 0 when the key is missing or has no value (empty string values still print empty)
+
 ### Fixed
 
 - Fix a package build deprecation warning caused by a non-string `license` value in `pyproject.toml` by [@kurtmckee] in [#648]
